{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purge the Beautiful Yet Deadly Anomalies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies are spreading chaos across the world\u2014each one mesmerizingly beautiful, yet undeniably lethal.<br>Your mission is simple: <strong>Purify them.</strong><br>Become the exorcist James, and face the most enchanting but dangerous foes ever known.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/de1a6f313b93600ea49828b9f25e0f36.poster.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1170 height=741 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/de1a6f313b93600ea49828b9f25e0f36.webm?t=1769413357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2D Pixel Art Action Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Will Purify You</strong> is a fast-paced 2D pixel-art action game filled with stylish, adrenaline-pumping combat.<br>Each region features entirely different layouts, threats, and attack patterns.<br>The Anomalies you must purify are powerful\u2026 but the battles are all the more thrilling because of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/18b58239f49f07e06f66b8dd09e65a62.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures once believed to exist only in myth\u2014<strong>Anomalies</strong>\u2014have begun appearing across the real world.<br>These beings, awakened from legends and folklore, are the <strong>bosses</strong> you must confront.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stop the spreading chaos, James\u2014the exorcist of the Soul Demon Hunters (that\u2019s you, sir!)\u2014sets out on a global journey to purify them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only one who can stop this myth-bred disaster from consuming the world\u2026\u00a0<strong>is you.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/7cfac462a92a3d3a6d9f08a4bf6d4112.poster.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/7cfac462a92a3d3a6d9f08a4bf6d4112.webm?t=1769413357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/7db2c7a4b7ae75308f1eebe695f8e447.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission: Purification for the Sake of Humanity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As James, you\u2019ll chase down hordes of Anomalies, test your strength in intense combat, and grow stronger with every encounter. The stronger you become, the longer you survive\u2014 and the longer you survive, the more you can purify.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for humanity\u2019s peace, James!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/e2ebe7aa70ff4b4c939fec2f660fce85.poster.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/e2ebe7aa70ff4b4c939fec2f660fce85.webm?t=1769413357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/a0bde39773d718e6d310b591948f915c.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adaptive Combat Through Weapon Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials and currency during battle to unlock new weapons and Exorcism Powers.<br>Your arsenal includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lightsaber straight out of a sci-fi film</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacred relic weapons born from ancient legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even an adorable cat-themed weapon!?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dozens of weapon types to craft your own build.<br>But nothing comes for free\u2014every recipe must be earned through combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/387d302ee61d09dd4f1c26fd318dbb88.poster.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/387d302ee61d09dd4f1c26fd318dbb88.webm?t=1769413357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/79258b336c036b5c9c7979ad7cfe7ebe.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounter Mythical Female Anomalies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each region awaits a legendary female boss:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each inspired by a different global myth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wielding unique supernatural abilities and patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each provoked by your growing strength</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To purify these beautiful but deadly beings, you\u2019ll need focus, strategy, and relentless power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/f0df1d887d33de3f1822308bca5ccf84.poster.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/f0df1d887d33de3f1822308bca5ccf84.webm?t=1769413357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/456b6412083de56ced67e897ce483109.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dangerous, Alluring Memories with Them</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During purification, James encounters powerful female Anomalies\u2014 and <strong>IPU\u2019s exclusive system</strong> lets you experience their subtle expressions, vivid body lines, animations, and voices up close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014 their charm is irresistible, and their danger is real. A moment of hesitation may turn you into prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your encounters with them are not just battles\u2026 they\u2019re unforgettable, seductive, and deadly memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/c8748f7052f24d83e0b5b4adb359b171.poster.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1170 height=741 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/c8748f7052f24d83e0b5b4adb359b171.webm?t=1769413357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/4b350258f1bb87c657cb435c822b81c7.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A modern take on classic 2D pixel-art action.</strong> Crisp animation, expressive characters, stylish effects, and a retro aesthetic refined for today\u2019s players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced side-scrolling combat.</strong> Dash, dodge, slash, purify\u2014master James\u2019s exorcist skills to survive intensifying waves of supernatural threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six beautifully deadly bosses.</strong> Each inspired by local myths around the world, armed with unique supernatural abilities and unforgettable personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless monster waves!</strong> Push your reflexes to the limit as enemies swarm from every direction\u2014stay sharp and stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect mysterious field items.</strong> Discover artifacts that unleash powerful effects, change builds, or help you survive impossible situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr. Lee\u2019s Weapon Shop.</strong> Gather money during battle and purchase weapon recipes to craft everything from laser-like blades to legendary relics\u2026 and even a cute cat weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade through the Battle Shop.</strong> Improve your stats, enhance your abilities, and shape your combat style after each boss encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train inside the Bunker.</strong> Strengthen your body, unlock new skills, and push beyond human limits\u2014power always comes with sacrifice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunter Network System.</strong> Recruit new playable hunters, each with their own abilities, skill awakenings, and unique combat identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big, beautiful pixel art.</strong> Detailed effects, dynamic animations, expressive characters, and handcrafted backgrounds bring every region to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming characters &amp; treacherous foes.</strong> From seductive bosses to strange anomalies, every encounter leaves a lasting impression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balanced for everyone.</strong> Easy to pick up, satisfying to master\u2014newcomers and action experts will both find the perfect challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global folklore, reimagined.</strong> Travel across regions inspired by myths and legends from around the world and purify the anomalies born from them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game+ for the brave.</strong> After surviving your first hunt, return stronger and push the challenge to the next level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re also preparing stage-specific quests, a full original soundtrack and more!<br><strong>All of these will be released soon\u2014so add the game to your Wishlist now and get ready for the hunt!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2950350/3162584f55ba18fc332b466769af0dc9d41b5be4.jpg"},{"name":"Is This Really Okay?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2950350/180a3efe3eab79dfb05a4c4cfb92a9df8dc4f208.jpg"},{"name":"Wait, This is a Depot and I Need Money?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2950350/b4a5b3c02a1edb15d17e2f5a3e7a2b4c85c0f535.jpg"},{"name":"Seriously, All by Myself?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2950350/8fdc41f67836fca4db96f474b9952dc12dbee2ca.jpg"},{"name":"Everyone Here Speaks English, Right?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2950350/4ac6164d6ef323c4b02285b4dd3d7db08797b915.jpg"},{"name":"How Do I Use This Thing?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2950350/6b73dfd38db14bebc33e7cd53c5383c51f968d48.jpg"},{"name":"Now That\u2019s More Like It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2950350/465d5b1a8ce89eed20620f2edeed28eab58c469f.jpg"},{"name":"Today Feels Like a Good Day for This Weapon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2950350/67fc6726d26f358d2f7041f8e49b90854d7117f5.jpg"},{"name":"Let\u2019s Just Blow It All Up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2950350/bf5382f6a1bf71af15a0ef41765322e483d5c52b.jpg"},{"name":"Are We at War or Something?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2950350/b296d0f1e7281ed0f1ec8c1d65cdee3a97143b99.jpg"}],"total":64},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2950350?t=1769413357","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769413357","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/6d4308ef3e3854bde8184fa1e2c129509a7d5824/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769413357","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/6d4308ef3e3854bde8184fa1e2c129509a7d5824/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769413357","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"[Caution]\r\n1. The game includes common adult sexual content and behaviors associated with certain sexual positions (BDSM, paizuri, oral, anal sex).\r\n2. This game does not include sexual assault/unconsensual sexual intercourse, incest, self-harm and suicide, or description or use of illegal drugs.\r\n3. All characters are set as adult monsters over the age of 20.\r\n4. Certain story events include conversations in which characters make sexual suggestions.\r\n5. Alcohol and tobacco consumption as in-game items are shown."},"demos":[{"appid":3406670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purge the Beautiful Yet Deadly Anomalies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies are spreading chaos across the world\u2014each one mesmerizingly beautiful, yet undeniably lethal.<br>Your mission is simple: <strong>Purify them.</strong><br>Become the exorcist James, and face the most enchanting but dangerous foes ever known.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/de1a6f313b93600ea49828b9f25e0f36.poster.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1170 height=741 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/de1a6f313b93600ea49828b9f25e0f36.webm?t=1769413357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2D Pixel Art Action Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Will Purify You</strong> is a fast-paced 2D pixel-art action game filled with stylish, adrenaline-pumping combat.<br>Each region features entirely different layouts, threats, and attack patterns.<br>The Anomalies you must purify are powerful\u2026 but the battles are all the more thrilling because of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/18b58239f49f07e06f66b8dd09e65a62.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures once believed to exist only in myth\u2014<strong>Anomalies</strong>\u2014have begun appearing across the real world.<br>These beings, awakened from legends and folklore, are the <strong>bosses</strong> you must confront.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stop the spreading chaos, James\u2014the exorcist of the Soul Demon Hunters (that\u2019s you, sir!)\u2014sets out on a global journey to purify them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only one who can stop this myth-bred disaster from consuming the world\u2026\u00a0<strong>is you.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/7cfac462a92a3d3a6d9f08a4bf6d4112.poster.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/7cfac462a92a3d3a6d9f08a4bf6d4112.webm?t=1769413357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/7db2c7a4b7ae75308f1eebe695f8e447.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission: Purification for the Sake of Humanity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As James, you\u2019ll chase down hordes of Anomalies, test your strength in intense combat, and grow stronger with every encounter. The stronger you become, the longer you survive\u2014 and the longer you survive, the more you can purify.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for humanity\u2019s peace, James!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/e2ebe7aa70ff4b4c939fec2f660fce85.poster.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/e2ebe7aa70ff4b4c939fec2f660fce85.webm?t=1769413357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/a0bde39773d718e6d310b591948f915c.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adaptive Combat Through Weapon Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials and currency during battle to unlock new weapons and Exorcism Powers.<br>Your arsenal includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lightsaber straight out of a sci-fi film</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacred relic weapons born from ancient legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even an adorable cat-themed weapon!?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dozens of weapon types to craft your own build.<br>But nothing comes for free\u2014every recipe must be earned through combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/387d302ee61d09dd4f1c26fd318dbb88.poster.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/387d302ee61d09dd4f1c26fd318dbb88.webm?t=1769413357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/79258b336c036b5c9c7979ad7cfe7ebe.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounter Mythical Female Anomalies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each region awaits a legendary female boss:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each inspired by a different global myth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wielding unique supernatural abilities and patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each provoked by your growing strength</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To purify these beautiful but deadly beings, you\u2019ll need focus, strategy, and relentless power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/f0df1d887d33de3f1822308bca5ccf84.poster.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1170 height=740 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/f0df1d887d33de3f1822308bca5ccf84.webm?t=1769413357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/456b6412083de56ced67e897ce483109.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dangerous, Alluring Memories with Them</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During purification, James encounters powerful female Anomalies\u2014 and <strong>IPU\u2019s exclusive system</strong> lets you experience their subtle expressions, vivid body lines, animations, and voices up close.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014 their charm is irresistible, and their danger is real. A moment of hesitation may turn you into prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your encounters with them are not just battles\u2026 they\u2019re unforgettable, seductive, and deadly memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/c8748f7052f24d83e0b5b4adb359b171.poster.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1170 height=741 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/c8748f7052f24d83e0b5b4adb359b171.webm?t=1769413357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/extras/4b350258f1bb87c657cb435c822b81c7.avif?t=1769413357\" width=1270 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A modern take on classic 2D pixel-art action.</strong> Crisp animation, expressive characters, stylish effects, and a retro aesthetic refined for today\u2019s players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced side-scrolling combat.</strong> Dash, dodge, slash, purify\u2014master James\u2019s exorcist skills to survive intensifying waves of supernatural threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six beautifully deadly bosses.</strong> Each inspired by local myths around the world, armed with unique supernatural abilities and unforgettable personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless monster waves!</strong> Push your reflexes to the limit as enemies swarm from every direction\u2014stay sharp and stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect mysterious field items.</strong> Discover artifacts that unleash powerful effects, change builds, or help you survive impossible situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr. Lee\u2019s Weapon Shop.</strong> Gather money during battle and purchase weapon recipes to craft everything from laser-like blades to legendary relics\u2026 and even a cute cat weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade through the Battle Shop.</strong> Improve your stats, enhance your abilities, and shape your combat style after each boss encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train inside the Bunker.</strong> Strengthen your body, unlock new skills, and push beyond human limits\u2014power always comes with sacrifice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunter Network System.</strong> Recruit new playable hunters, each with their own abilities, skill awakenings, and unique combat identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big, beautiful pixel art.</strong> Detailed effects, dynamic animations, expressive characters, and handcrafted backgrounds bring every region to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming characters &amp; treacherous foes.</strong> From seductive bosses to strange anomalies, every encounter leaves a lasting impression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balanced for everyone.</strong> Easy to pick up, satisfying to master\u2014newcomers and action experts will both find the perfect challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global folklore, reimagined.</strong> Travel across regions inspired by myths and legends from around the world and purify the anomalies born from them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game+ for the brave.</strong> After surviving your first hunt, return stronger and push the challenge to the next level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re also preparing stage-specific quests, a full original soundtrack and more!<br><strong>All of these will be released soon\u2014so add the game to your Wishlist now and get ready for the hunt!</strong></p>","developers":["Cheese Burger Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950350/c2db8b0ed054902198a59ddac26481568c49c6fa/header.jpg?t=1769413357","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2950350/970077104/d3e6033f22b102c9e430af43adb3d1e7ee6a2cc5/1769412125/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769413356","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2950350/970077104/d3e6033f22b102c9e430af43adb3d1e7ee6a2cc5/1769412125/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769413356","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2950350/97007710